editor_description = "The king on horseback, one FIGURE of the royal regiment's piece (MapObjects.royal_regiment). The 3D map (Map3DLayerUnits) stands 9 / 6 / 3 instances of this scene in formation and plays its clips by order; the WAR ROOM paints tin over this material's albedo (WarPieces) and the folio inks the whole figure (WarInkFigure). Its material, shadow and look are edited HERE; the clips' loops are the .glb's import settings; its sizes are data/army_art.csv."

